2. The following goods are prescribed goods for the purpose of section 10 of the Act:
(a)wines;
(b)spirits;
(c)beers;
(d)cheese;
(e)meat and meat products;
(f)seafood;
(g)edible oils;
(h)non‑edible oils;
(i)fruits;
(j)vegetables;
(k)spices and condiments;
(l)confectionery and baked goods;
(m)flowers and parts of flowers;
(n)natural gum;
[S 524/2026 wef 01/08/2026]
(o)coffee.
